{"availability":"available","full":"jhtjernsmo/fjord","name":"fjord","description":"Local-first project management, Linux first, also on Windows and macOS: kanban, notes with [[links]] and files in SQLite. Keyboard-first, mouse-friendly, with a CLI and MCP server for AI agents.","category":"Productivity","language":"Rust","stars":3,"forks":0,"created":"2026-10-07T09:05:13Z","updated":"2026-10-10T10:12:25Z","license":null,"branch":"main","homepage":"https://jhtjernsmo.github.io/fjord/","topics":["kanban","keyboard-driven","linux","local-first","mcp","project-management","react","rust","sqlite","tauri"],"demo":"https://jhtjernsmo.github.io/fjord/","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T19:00:27.183Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-10T19:00:27.183Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-10T19:00:27.183Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-08T07:35:25.528Z","stars":0,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-10T19:00:27.183Z","stars":3,"forks":0}],"technologies":["React","Rust"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Local-first project management — Linux first, also on Windows & macOS. Built for the keyboard, friendly to the mouse, and open to AI agents.","Fjord keeps your projects, kanban boards, files and notes in a single SQLite database on your own machine. No account, no cloud, no telemetry. It's a lightweight native desktop app (Tauri), a scriptable CLI, and an MCP server — so you and your AI assistant can work in the same projects, and you can always see who did what."],"features":["Projects & kanban boards — drag and drop, or move tasks with H/L. Rename, recolor, reorder and add columns.","Tasks — markdown descriptions, priority, due dates, overdue warnings, archive & restore.","Files — drop files onto the window to attach them to a project or task. Stored content-addressed (deduplicated) with image previews.","Themes — five built-in themes (Fjord Dark/Light, Nord, Solarized Light, High Contrast), follow the OS with separate light/dark picks, or build your own with live preview: colours, text size, rounding and density; share…","Subtasks — break a task into subtasks (one level) with their own status, priority and branch; cards show progress (2/5), the task panel lists them with check-off, drag to reorder and A to add."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/jhtjernsmo/fjord/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"214b6c7023219c35722f700b5817292a74612112f44e431ef2e01ec0c2c1158b","extractedAt":"2026-10-08T07:35:25.870Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T07:35:25.870Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Local-first project management — Linux first, also on Windows & macOS. Built for the keyboard, friendly to the mouse, and open to AI agents.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/jhtjernsmo/fjord/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[{"text":"Local-first project management — Linux first, also on Windows & macOS. Built for the keyboard, friendly to the mouse, and open to AI agents.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/jhtjernsmo/fjord/blob/main/README.md"}],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"documented","text":"No account, no cloud, no telemetry.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/jhtjernsmo/fjord/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"api_key","status":"required","text":"GitHub access (needed for private repositories and opening PRs) comes from, in order: GITHUBTOKEN/GHTOKEN, a Sign in with GitHub in Settings (browser sign-in, OAuth device flow) or a personal access token pasted there, or gh auth login.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/jhtjernsmo/fjord/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"GitHub access (needed for private repositories and opening PRs) comes from, in order: GITHUBTOKEN/GHTOKEN, a Sign in with GitHub in Settings (browser sign-in, OAuth device flow) or a personal access token pasted there, or gh auth login.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/jhtjernsmo/fjord/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"api_key","status":"required","text":"Auth comes from AZUREDEVOPSEXTPAT, a personal access token per organi